<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups in Nigeria's Niger state killed at least 30 civilians in a reprisal attack and later kidnapped a Saudi national, while armed men killed 13 National Guard members and an attack killed 13 soldiers in western Niger. Bandits razed an entire village in Niger, killing three people, and jihadists threatened to cut off a town in northern Mali. Insurgents are now employing off-the-shelf drones in attacks. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOX09kRWFacG5teU43bTdiNXNueFVzaFRva2hNUFFwMVlOeDZ2TFdKTkljV0hRQ0VpTkRWZnRvSmZRTUJpYXVacy02RUlUZGQ3NVJhS2JuelFjbTE5ZkY1Sm82Nk1FQTZZMFpfSW5NN1UzcF9hQ0hma0hKWE54dzducUMzQU9iUkFxSUo5YnE3NTBudw?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE43LVl0bXp0UVl1d19NRDFQdDdFcnFtZTlHOTRRNGtXTlNiNU1vcGg4aGxNbEtyQmFfSTEybzZGTkpBSFhUa3NldVkwZGo1Yld4SC1pZDJQVDJuMGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUW5aeXpDUldIYjR5RlZ2bVdyUHFKZUtRcEUwTERNc3ZTRVFWTlNRSEZjV05VMVNyNG1KTXZNelVaQUJVaUlObUlqYXl5MV85b0hrTDdJMlA4YVcyanRXVVhrV19vUjBqRmR2WDBzcnY2MlFsTjdoS0paNGFTQWdESk5Lcm9GeWNSbUN6dkJwbDhwWk5WR1FqWXVWS1dYVjFVcElvNDd2RS11NnprbVVUdWl3cVVkVC16?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQVHZmV2MtaGtLcUNwZlhJQ3lGLVRRZGZqV2hQbWpSakFTUWk1OWd5NlNlYUo4OHJQWHhhYjhrUDhDNTV1N09ycEtSSHd5RU85ZW1JRnhkc2pUdHZfSzN6Q2xGRi1OVDZra1U4MDg4cGxKYmhhanUxQy1iYmNSRFhhdkJBSENLUkNBSmwwWFFGUkc2cl9rNkc4cWpUbU41RklXSWhIa1Jqemc2RmhoaDkxenNFalB3S0JPQ0VFR3l0TkpuR0o2VGYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxON0RjeHRWcGl1ZElENEhBX0x2blI3b2w1OC1vZ1U3SklwRTV5ajRTWVRXczVBTlBrN0JkQldfZE